 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces killed Palestinian youth Abdel-Karim Sulaiman Bani Jaber on Tuesday morning following an operation in the Diriya area of Aqraba, south of Nablus, Shehab Wire reported. Forces surrounded his residence and opened fire, also deploying an energy projectile toward him during the confrontation.\n\nJaber was pronounced dead at the scene. Israeli forces subsequently took custody of his body, preventing immediate access by Palestinian medical personnel or family members, according to the report.",
